---
title: Posts
page-layout: full
sidebar: false
toc: false
aliases: [/nb/articles/index.html, /nb/notes/index.html]
---

Posts from across the knowledge base, newest first.

::: {.posts-layout}
::: {.posts-main}
<table class="table posts-table"><thead><tr><th aria-sort="descending"><button class="post-sort" data-sort="date">Date</button></th><th><button class="post-sort" data-sort="title">Title</button></th><th>Categories</th><th>Tags</th><th><button class="post-sort" data-sort="readingMinutes">Reading time</button></th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for post in posts %}
<tr data-post-tags="{{ post.tags | tojson | forceescape }}" data-date="{{ post.date or '' }}" data-title="{{ post.title | e }}" data-reading-minutes="{{ post.reading_minutes }}"><td>{{ post.date or '' }}</td><td><a href="{{ post.href | e }}">{{ post.title | e }}</a>{% if post.lifecycle != 'published' %} <span class="content-status">{{ post.lifecycle | e }}</span>{% endif %}{% if post.description %}<p>{{ post.description | e }}</p>{% endif %}</td><td>{{ post.categories | join(', ') | e }}</td><td>{% for tag in post.tags %}<a class="post-tag" href="?tag={{ tag | urlencode }}">{{ tag | e }}</a> {% endfor %}</td><td>{{ post.reading_minutes }} min</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody></table>
<p id="posts-empty" hidden>No posts match this tag.</p>
<nav class="posts-pagination" aria-label="Posts pages"><button id="posts-previous">Previous</button> <span id="posts-page"></span> <button id="posts-next">Next</button></nav>
:::
::: {.posts-sidebar}
### Tags
<button class="post-filter" data-tag="" aria-pressed="true">All posts ({{ posts | length }})</button>
{% for tag, count in tags %}
<button class="post-filter" data-tag="{{ tag | e }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ tag | e }} ({{ count }})</button>
{% endfor %}
:::
:::

<script src="assets/post-tags.js"></script>
